WEBVTT

00:21.062 --> 00:23.148
My arm!

00:25.942 --> 00:27.610
What is this all of a sudden?

00:27.694 --> 00:28.903
She won't slow us down.

00:28.987 --> 00:30.071
Stand up, asshole, okay?

00:30.155 --> 00:32.282
Hey there, Mango.

00:32.365 --> 00:34.200
Answer me this, having a good day?

00:34.284 --> 00:35.618
That hurts. Oh.

00:35.702 --> 00:36.953
What are you doing?

00:37.662 --> 00:38.788
She is my partner.

00:39.456 --> 00:40.457
Let go.

00:44.252 --> 00:45.253
Let go of him.

00:48.173 --> 00:49.549
Goddamn it.

00:51.051 --> 00:52.427
Hey, watch your mouth.

00:52.510 --> 00:54.637
My partner was just saying hello to you.

00:58.016 --> 00:58.850
You're brave…

01:01.144 --> 01:02.395
but you need more skills.

01:04.189 --> 01:06.191
Mm.

01:08.318 --> 01:09.861
What are you doing?

01:11.321 --> 01:12.489
You got a warrant?

01:13.615 --> 01:15.533
Uh, no. I don't have one.

01:17.494 --> 01:20.747
Well, you've known
for having tiny balls, Mango,

01:21.289 --> 01:23.958
but you attack a cop and demand a warrant.

01:24.042 --> 01:27.003
You're going overboard
so the drugs are here, right?

01:28.838 --> 01:29.881
What do you mean?

01:29.964 --> 01:31.549
What, what drugs are you talking about?

01:31.633 --> 01:34.385
Wow, you're stuttering. How cute.

01:35.011 --> 01:36.304
You know.

01:36.846 --> 01:38.223
The small ones…

01:38.306 --> 01:40.058
The black ones…

01:40.642 --> 01:42.769
Who does this money
belong to, huh?

01:42.852 --> 01:44.479
Shall we talk to the people inside?

01:44.562 --> 01:46.106
I wonder how much they are gambling.

01:46.189 --> 01:47.398
Wait, hold on!

01:48.274 --> 01:49.484
You, don't move.

01:51.319 --> 01:52.987
You can't even handle this.

01:53.571 --> 01:56.116
Hang on, you can't do this
even if you are a cop.

01:56.199 --> 01:58.284
Yes, I can.
To an asshole like you.

01:58.368 --> 01:59.410
Come on.

01:59.494 --> 02:01.996
- Hey! Everyone, freeze!
- Hang on.

02:02.080 --> 02:03.790
This is the police!

02:03.873 --> 02:07.919
Leave all the money on the table
and show me some ID's!

02:08.002 --> 02:09.087
ID's out!

02:09.170 --> 02:11.548
You're all getting busted.

02:11.631 --> 02:14.092
- Get your ID's out.
- Detective.

02:14.676 --> 02:16.261
Detective Jeon Pildo!

02:17.512 --> 02:19.597
Why are you doing this?

02:19.681 --> 02:20.515
Why?

02:20.598 --> 02:22.392
Where are the drugs?

02:23.476 --> 02:26.229
Oh, man, what drug are you talking about?

02:27.147 --> 02:29.482
We don't even have Tylenol here.

02:29.566 --> 02:31.734
Ah, didn't you hide it here last time?

02:34.279 --> 02:37.073
Right, you hid it up there
last time too, yeah?

02:37.157 --> 02:38.366
It was high up.

02:38.449 --> 02:40.743
You runt. Let's go.

02:40.827 --> 02:43.371
Hey, now, this isn't a pharmacy.

02:43.454 --> 02:45.123
I can't even reach up here.

02:45.206 --> 02:46.457
There's nothing up there!

02:46.541 --> 02:47.876
What are you looking for?

02:47.959 --> 02:49.627
- You little shit.
- Oh, my gosh.

02:49.711 --> 02:50.795
- Hey!
- Yo!

02:50.879 --> 02:52.463
You're obstructing my business.

02:52.547 --> 02:54.632
Huh? I'm the one that needs drugs.

02:57.010 --> 02:58.094
What…

02:58.178 --> 02:59.220
Why…

03:00.430 --> 03:01.973
That fucking bitch.

03:20.742 --> 03:22.619
Shit. She found it.

03:22.702 --> 03:24.037
- Oh, yeah.
- Yeah.

03:24.120 --> 03:25.288
Get over here, you asshole.

03:25.371 --> 03:27.081
- Uh… Hold on.
- Come on now. Look here.

03:27.749 --> 03:29.209
Asshole.

03:29.292 --> 03:30.877
I'm so screwed.

03:35.006 --> 03:37.717
Take, take it easy. I'm injured right now.

03:37.800 --> 03:40.094
Come on!

03:41.346 --> 03:42.347
Ah!

03:44.390 --> 03:45.725
Oh, shit.

03:47.769 --> 03:49.854
Hey, so… I'm talking right now!

03:49.938 --> 03:53.274
I said to bring Mango out,
not beat everyone.

03:53.858 --> 03:55.235
They wouldn't listen to me.

03:55.860 --> 03:58.446
It wasn't because you wanted to show me
how tough you are?

04:01.908 --> 04:04.202
Didn't you wanna test
what I was capable of?

04:06.537 --> 04:07.789
Don't do that again.

04:11.084 --> 04:13.169
What you're wearing
isn't even bulletproof.

04:14.003 --> 04:16.464
This isn't Violent Crimes, you know.

04:17.966 --> 04:19.175
Yeah, I get it.

04:23.596 --> 04:25.348
Where did you get this?

04:27.809 --> 04:29.978
Detective Oh isn't a complete flake.

04:30.061 --> 04:32.230
It was just a gift. Yeah.

04:32.313 --> 04:34.232
It's just a sample I was given.

04:35.191 --> 04:37.110
Exactly. Who gave it to you?

04:39.779 --> 04:40.822
Shit.

04:45.660 --> 04:47.787
- Send it to NFS.
- Sir.

04:50.581 --> 04:51.624
So, Mango.

04:52.917 --> 04:55.128
How many years will you get this time?

04:55.878 --> 04:58.131
Are you besties with the drug dealer?

04:58.214 --> 04:59.966
Shit. Goddamn it.

05:06.097 --> 05:07.682
This guy is…

05:08.808 --> 05:10.643
really scary.

05:24.407 --> 05:27.201
Why did the gods create drugs?

05:29.495 --> 05:31.331
They open Pandora's box.

05:31.998 --> 05:34.500
The last sliver of hope?

05:35.251 --> 05:36.586
I don't think so.

05:38.171 --> 05:39.380
Drugs.

05:41.549 --> 05:44.886
War, death, poverty, disease.

05:44.969 --> 05:46.804
Why must we endure these hardships?

05:46.888 --> 05:48.097
Forget them.

05:51.267 --> 05:53.102
If you put this in your mouth,

05:53.186 --> 05:56.230
your fears disappear
and you become a superhero.

05:57.273 --> 05:59.692
Not a trace left in your body.

06:00.193 --> 06:02.653
It's a gift from the gods.

06:05.198 --> 06:06.949
That's an enticing offer.

06:07.533 --> 06:10.620
But, uh, Choi Mujin won't stand for it.

06:12.830 --> 06:15.583
Meth is a thing of the past now.

06:24.384 --> 06:26.761
Go out and get yourselves a black suit.

06:28.221 --> 06:29.931
Get ready for a funeral.

06:33.434 --> 06:34.811
Mango was arrested.

06:36.062 --> 06:37.063
He was?

06:37.772 --> 06:39.774
He had a new kind of drug.

06:39.857 --> 06:41.609
That's what Narcotics is looking for.

06:42.610 --> 06:44.112
And where is it from?

06:44.695 --> 06:45.822
I don't know yet.

06:46.406 --> 06:47.698
I'll figure it out.

06:47.782 --> 06:48.866
Okay then.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.579
Call in Mr. Jung.

07:01.212 --> 07:02.797
I registered you into the system.

07:04.674 --> 07:05.550
Oh.

07:06.175 --> 07:07.218
Thanks.

07:13.975 --> 07:15.601
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

07:15.685 --> 07:16.894
DATABASE

07:22.316 --> 07:24.610
2016 DONGCHEON YOON DONGHOON

07:30.491 --> 07:31.617
MURDER OF DONGCHEON'S
HEAD OF OPERATIONS

07:31.701 --> 07:32.618
YOON DONGHOON

07:37.790 --> 07:39.333
UNIDENTIFIED MAN IN BLACK HOODIE
ENTERING APARTMENT

07:40.042 --> 07:41.794
JUNG TAEJU WAS WITH YOON DONGHOON

07:41.878 --> 07:43.754
AT THE FINAL LOCATION BEFORE HIS DEATH

07:49.051 --> 07:50.720
Donghoon's killer is a policeman.

07:50.803 --> 07:53.014
IDENTICAL TO THE POLICE ISSUE MODEL

07:53.097 --> 07:54.515
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE
BULLET 1

07:55.975 --> 07:57.185
ON THE DAY OF YOON DONGHOON'S DEATH,

07:57.268 --> 07:58.644
LIEUTENANT CHA GIHO
AND CORPORAL KIM TAEUK

07:58.728 --> 08:01.939
WERE AT AN OPERATION TO CAPTURE
DRUG PRODUCER BAE JUNGOO

08:08.529 --> 08:10.072
Would you like some coffee?

08:11.282 --> 08:12.200
Mm-hmm.

08:30.468 --> 08:31.636
You haven't gone home?

08:32.678 --> 08:33.679
No.

09:06.170 --> 09:07.547
I hear that there's a new drug.

09:08.548 --> 09:09.465
Yes, sir.

09:10.049 --> 09:11.008
I've heard rumors.

09:14.428 --> 09:17.265
Because of Mr. Bae, for three weeks,
we couldn't supply drugs.

09:18.015 --> 09:20.226
During that time,
was the new drug ring formed?

09:20.309 --> 09:21.978
I can look into it now, sir.

09:22.061 --> 09:23.020
There's no need.

09:24.355 --> 09:25.606
Jiwoo will find it.

09:29.527 --> 09:32.113
I'VE ARRIVED IN TOKYO. YOU MUST MEET
DEADLINES ONCE THE DEAL IS MADE.

09:33.614 --> 09:34.740
And the factory?

09:34.824 --> 09:36.492
Yes, we have obtained it, sir.

09:36.576 --> 09:38.327
- Where?
- The North Port.

09:41.831 --> 09:43.291
I'll go myself and check.

09:50.548 --> 09:51.591
Nice to meet you.

09:51.674 --> 09:53.926
I am Kang Sooyeon.

09:55.136 --> 09:59.473
Our chairman
would have come personally, but…

10:02.476 --> 10:05.521
Then, shall we get to business?

10:21.912 --> 10:25.082
It's the best quality product
on the market right now.

10:25.750 --> 10:30.379
We call them "Diamonds".

10:32.089 --> 10:33.591
It is of top quality.

10:46.479 --> 10:48.105
We'll take them.

10:48.189 --> 10:50.650
Bring the goods here in ten days.

10:50.733 --> 10:53.027
Yes, sir. Understood.

11:19.637 --> 11:22.473
Dang it. Carbs make me fat,
but they taste so good.

11:22.556 --> 11:25.685
All food is fattening
when you're old, man.

11:25.768 --> 11:27.978
You, jerk. So you don't want it?

11:28.062 --> 11:29.438
Ah, you lost.

11:31.649 --> 11:33.776
- Here you are, Detective Oh.
- Thank you.

11:35.486 --> 11:37.405
Detective Ko Gunpyeong.

11:40.032 --> 11:40.866
This one? Hm.

11:44.036 --> 11:45.955
We're not questioning Mango anymore?

11:46.038 --> 11:48.582
He has intel, so we have to keep him
locked up for now.

11:48.666 --> 11:50.584
He'll talk if we don't give him attention.

11:51.502 --> 11:53.003
What about investigating?

11:53.587 --> 11:54.630
Hey.

11:56.132 --> 11:58.384
What is the first quality of a good cop?

12:00.177 --> 12:03.347
For Narcotics, wouldn't it be information?

12:03.431 --> 12:04.432
That's wrong.

12:04.515 --> 12:05.683
It's patience.

12:06.559 --> 12:09.145
If you can wait, you'll catch them.

12:10.563 --> 12:11.522
Go eat.

12:21.282 --> 12:24.952
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

12:39.300 --> 12:41.385
Captain. The target's on the move.

12:42.470 --> 12:43.679
Let's go.

12:45.765 --> 12:46.807
Call for backup.

12:46.891 --> 12:47.892
Sir.

12:49.018 --> 12:50.978
- Let's go.
- Come on. We're heading out.

12:52.897 --> 12:55.065
Number 20K70637.

12:55.149 --> 12:56.192
Corporal Oh Hyejin.

12:59.111 --> 13:00.154
Okay.

13:07.870 --> 13:09.705
So, remove your cell phones.

13:24.136 --> 13:24.970
Tonight,

13:26.430 --> 13:27.973
our target is…

13:32.770 --> 13:34.230
…Choi Mujin.

13:44.323 --> 13:45.699
Choi Mujin.

13:46.575 --> 13:48.494
He's the owner of Hotel Liber.

13:48.577 --> 13:51.622
He's the leader of the largest drug ring
in our country Dongcheon.

13:51.705 --> 13:54.375
They sell 90 percent of methamphetamine.

13:55.084 --> 13:59.296
Bae Jungoo, their middle man, the CEO
of a shipping firm, committed suicide.

13:59.380 --> 14:02.925
But a ship owned by Bae
arrived from Thailand two days ago.

14:03.008 --> 14:04.802
Choi Mujin took over that factory.

14:06.345 --> 14:08.347
North Port Section K.

14:09.932 --> 14:12.393
Choi Mujin will arrive in 50 minutes.

14:12.476 --> 14:14.937
Narcotics Teams Alpha and Beta
will go inside.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.146
The rest will back them up.

14:16.230 --> 14:17.773
HOTEL LIBER CHOI MUJIN, MONITOR 1

14:21.652 --> 14:23.279
Focus on this one man.

14:24.530 --> 14:26.407
We must arrest Choi Mujin.

14:26.490 --> 14:27.658
Do you understand?

14:28.284 --> 14:29.368
Yes, sir.

14:29.869 --> 14:31.120
Move out.

14:36.208 --> 14:37.209
Let's go.

14:52.182 --> 14:53.559
Here's your body cam.

14:54.268 --> 14:56.145
- Back up your data.
- I will.

14:56.687 --> 14:57.730
Hey.

14:58.689 --> 15:01.859
Make sure we get Choi Mujin
and the evidence. Okay?

15:01.942 --> 15:03.360
Yes, sir.

15:04.361 --> 15:06.363
Don't you be nervous. Got it?

15:38.771 --> 15:40.856
We're going radio silent now.

16:13.222 --> 16:15.140
Hold positions and standby.

16:18.185 --> 16:19.561
Thank you for coming here.

16:21.730 --> 16:23.774
- Is that the workshop?
- Yes.

16:23.857 --> 16:27.027
We get materials in Thailand,
and we manufacture at sea.

16:27.111 --> 16:28.654
Please come this way.

16:47.339 --> 16:48.674
One, in position.

16:49.174 --> 16:51.010
Two, in position.
Choi Mujin is confirmed.

16:52.928 --> 16:54.013
Infiltrate.

18:25.771 --> 18:26.688
Get him!

18:27.272 --> 18:29.191
Get him! Don't let him get away!

18:59.388 --> 19:00.764
They look like the crew.

19:00.848 --> 19:02.766
They claim they don't know
about the drugs.

19:02.850 --> 19:03.934
Keep going.

19:04.017 --> 19:04.977
We're going in.

19:58.030 --> 20:00.282
Remember,
the target is Choi Mujin.

20:00.365 --> 20:01.950
We need evidence.

20:23.639 --> 20:24.973
What's going on?

20:25.474 --> 20:27.768
Hey, Pildo! Pildo!

20:27.851 --> 20:29.978
Listen up,
there's a situation with Pildo.

20:30.062 --> 20:32.439
Team Two, move to Team One now. Hurry up!

20:32.981 --> 20:34.983
Now, we won't be short
on our supply.

20:36.401 --> 20:37.736
Seems Mr. Bae was smart.

20:42.658 --> 20:44.284
Yamamoto's goods are ready.

20:44.368 --> 20:45.369
Sir.

21:29.913 --> 21:31.415
Choi Mujin, put your hands up!

21:33.333 --> 21:34.668
Put that down!

21:35.419 --> 21:36.628
No, stop!

21:36.712 --> 21:40.215
Choi Mujin, you're under arrest
for the manufacture of illegal drugs.

21:40.757 --> 21:42.050
Don't, Jung Taeju!

21:44.678 --> 21:46.638
Are you okay? Who fired that shot?

21:51.476 --> 21:53.603
Hey, Pildo. Pildo!

21:53.687 --> 21:54.938
Freeze, Choi Mujin!

22:01.486 --> 22:02.529
Get Choi Mujin.

22:02.612 --> 22:04.323
Don't let him get away!

22:05.324 --> 22:07.034
Freeze, Choi Mujin!

22:21.214 --> 22:23.300
That's Choi Mujin, damnit.
He's getting away.

22:32.851 --> 22:33.894
Damn it! Let's go!

22:42.861 --> 22:44.571
- Where's Choi Mujin?
- Choi Mujin?

22:44.654 --> 22:46.114
- We have to find him.
- He was here?

22:46.198 --> 22:47.491
- Find Choi Mujin!
- Let's find him. Come on!

23:18.271 --> 23:19.314
Find him?

23:21.775 --> 23:22.734
- You.
- Yes?

23:22.818 --> 23:24.111
Go check the inside of the ship again.

23:24.194 --> 23:25.070
Yes, sir.

23:30.951 --> 23:32.369
Did you see who fired?

23:34.287 --> 23:35.455
Damn!

23:42.587 --> 23:45.715
Damn it. With that crack,
we can't even use it as evidence.

23:49.136 --> 23:50.220
- Captain.
- Huh?

23:50.303 --> 23:51.221
This is it.

24:31.344 --> 24:32.929
These are crazy people.

24:41.563 --> 24:42.689
Captain.

25:17.599 --> 25:18.683
Shit!

25:35.992 --> 25:37.619
Shit!

25:40.330 --> 25:42.999
Cha Giho was after us.

25:43.083 --> 25:44.292
We didn't realize it sooner

25:44.376 --> 25:45.627
- because they--
- Taeju.

25:48.713 --> 25:49.798
Who are we?

25:51.550 --> 25:53.718
Did you forget who we are
because we wear designer suits

25:53.802 --> 25:55.011
and have fancy titles?

25:57.055 --> 25:58.139
I'm sorry.

26:00.684 --> 26:02.477
Find who is sneaking our information.

26:03.311 --> 26:05.230
Yes, sir.

26:06.439 --> 26:07.482
But…

26:09.609 --> 26:11.319
why didn't Jiwoo contact us?

26:26.543 --> 26:28.461
We checked,
and no one from our team

26:28.545 --> 26:29.838
discharged their weapon.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.840
Really?

26:35.135 --> 26:36.886
Well, good work today, Captain Lee.

26:46.062 --> 26:48.398
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

27:03.830 --> 27:06.041
The person you reached is not available.

27:06.124 --> 27:08.001
Please leave a message after the tone.

27:35.654 --> 27:39.324
INCOMING CALL

27:52.212 --> 27:54.214
CALLING…

27:54.297 --> 27:55.548
CALL ENDED

28:03.765 --> 28:05.183
Look at this.

28:05.266 --> 28:06.142
Look.

28:06.685 --> 28:08.895
You and Choi Mujin were talking together.

28:08.978 --> 28:10.105
I saw you.

28:11.231 --> 28:12.816
Choi Mujin was there!

28:14.526 --> 28:16.611
I don't know anything.

28:17.779 --> 28:19.406
Shit. This fucker…

28:20.115 --> 28:21.074
Come on.

28:21.616 --> 28:22.575
Come here.

28:22.659 --> 28:24.869
- Whoa! Whoa! Hey! Stop that!
- Ooh…

28:24.953 --> 28:27.497
I saw you in there with Choi Mujin.

28:27.580 --> 28:29.207
So, talk. Talk!

28:40.635 --> 28:42.804
- Take out your guns.
- What?

28:43.763 --> 28:44.764
What…

28:52.439 --> 28:54.983
Captain. Wait. Do you suspect us?

28:56.609 --> 28:58.236
Hey, Captain.

29:03.283 --> 29:05.368
Captain. It wasn't us.

29:28.141 --> 29:29.184
Put them away.

29:32.771 --> 29:34.147
What the hell is going on?

29:35.440 --> 29:36.900
Ah, shit.

29:42.947 --> 29:44.240
Damn it.

29:44.324 --> 29:46.451
Were Park Changoo and Mango
just fake outs?

29:48.995 --> 29:51.831
We booked the small fries and waited
for Choi Mujin to let his guard down.

29:51.915 --> 29:54.209
So he was the actual target
all along then.

29:54.292 --> 29:56.044
We have to catch him in the act!

30:05.929 --> 30:07.180
Choi Mujin.

30:07.263 --> 30:09.849
Became the boss of Dongcheon 12 years ago.

30:09.933 --> 30:11.351
He was suspected of countless crimes

30:11.434 --> 30:13.895
including drug manufacture,
sales, assault,

30:13.978 --> 30:16.272
and murder-for-hire,
but he was never indicted.

30:16.856 --> 30:20.235
We never had enough evidence
and others always confessed for him.

30:26.324 --> 30:27.742
YOON DONGHOON
DIED IN 2016

30:31.788 --> 30:33.122
Yoon Donghoon.

30:33.206 --> 30:34.791
Choi Mujin's closest friend.

30:34.874 --> 30:36.584
Murdered five years ago.

30:39.879 --> 30:41.714
Do you know who murdered him?

30:41.798 --> 30:42.841
We don't know.

30:43.341 --> 30:44.968
We never found the murder weapon.

30:45.468 --> 30:46.886
- But--
- What happened?

30:54.185 --> 30:57.021
You found no evidence and burned the ship?

30:58.147 --> 30:59.107
Cha Giho.

30:59.607 --> 31:01.025
What are you doing?

31:01.943 --> 31:02.986
Sorry, sir.

31:03.528 --> 31:06.197
I told you not to act on your emotions.

31:06.698 --> 31:08.157
What will you do about this?

31:09.492 --> 31:11.160
We have to catch Choi Mujin.

31:13.079 --> 31:15.248
We have to kill that asshole!

31:22.171 --> 31:23.840
All of you, keep quiet.

31:25.842 --> 31:27.635
If this gets out, we're all dead.

31:34.559 --> 31:35.852
Get it together.

32:06.049 --> 32:08.885
Can't we just catch that asshole, huh?

32:11.054 --> 32:13.389
And who fired that shot, huh?

32:16.809 --> 32:18.561
How long have you been after him?

32:19.228 --> 32:22.315
Since before I joined Narcotics, uh,
four years.

32:23.107 --> 32:25.318
Why is Captain after him, specifically?

32:25.401 --> 32:26.402
Why else?

32:27.028 --> 32:29.197
We wanna take the largest drug ring down.

32:31.366 --> 32:33.534
Do you know how much drugs
Dongcheon distributes yearly?

32:34.786 --> 32:36.496
Yeah, but it's personal.

32:40.083 --> 32:43.169
A while back, the youngest member
of Narcotics died.

32:43.252 --> 32:46.172
I think it was around 2004
or something…

33:07.527 --> 33:09.237
So from then until now…

33:09.320 --> 33:10.279
Yeah.

33:10.363 --> 33:12.115
Just imagine…

33:13.116 --> 33:15.410
how the Captain must feel right now, yeah?

33:19.288 --> 33:20.456
What do we do now?

33:21.040 --> 33:22.250
What else can we do?

33:23.251 --> 33:24.502
We try again.

33:26.087 --> 33:27.964
Until the Dongcheon assholes are all gone.

33:30.341 --> 33:31.300
Here.

33:32.385 --> 33:34.220
How are you so chill, hmm?

33:36.389 --> 33:38.349
Oh, Junho. Over here.

33:39.517 --> 33:40.351
Junho.

33:40.435 --> 33:41.561
What? Junho's here?

33:41.644 --> 33:42.603
- Hey there.
- Huh?

33:42.687 --> 33:44.772
- I need to make a phone call.
- Oh, okay.

33:44.856 --> 33:45.773
Sit down.

33:45.857 --> 33:47.942
- Hey, kid. You okay?
- Oh, yeah.

33:48.026 --> 33:49.777
I'm glad you came.

33:49.861 --> 33:51.029
- Yeah…
- Another glass, please!

33:51.904 --> 33:53.239
That looks good.

33:53.322 --> 33:54.449
Yeah. Eat up!

33:59.245 --> 34:00.329
Are you okay?

34:04.500 --> 34:06.878
It was a raid,
I didn't know in advance.

34:08.212 --> 34:09.422
Do I have a tail?

34:10.214 --> 34:11.132
No.

34:14.093 --> 34:16.137
The hotel has cameras.

34:16.220 --> 34:18.097
And the hallway in front of the penthouse.

34:18.181 --> 34:20.600
The basement elevator entrance.
The garage exit.

34:20.683 --> 34:23.436
There are three cameras in those places.

34:26.522 --> 34:28.566
Which means someone is a mole.

34:29.984 --> 34:31.194
I'll find out.

34:34.072 --> 34:35.615
Did you shoot the gun?

34:37.492 --> 34:39.327
I had no way of contacting you.

34:41.537 --> 34:42.914
But I want you to know I…

34:46.084 --> 34:48.461
decided to use the gun at the crime scene.

34:50.755 --> 34:52.465
The truth will get out now…

34:55.802 --> 34:57.428
…since I left the gun.

35:34.465 --> 35:35.591
You know Junho?

35:35.675 --> 35:37.385
You sent him on vacation.

35:37.468 --> 35:39.178
We'll get you working again.
Don't worry about it.

35:39.262 --> 35:40.596
We'll all work together once you return.

35:40.680 --> 35:42.014
- Right?
- Yeah.

35:42.098 --> 35:43.349
Let's drink.

35:43.432 --> 35:44.517
You punks.

35:45.101 --> 35:46.811
- Cheers.
- Cheers!

36:15.047 --> 36:16.090
What?

36:19.677 --> 36:20.553
Daesoo.

36:20.636 --> 36:21.596
What?

36:22.471 --> 36:23.472
What?

36:24.432 --> 36:25.391
Hey.

36:26.100 --> 36:27.101
What's this?

36:30.521 --> 36:31.939
- What's going on?
- Ah…

36:32.023 --> 36:33.649
Shit. Goddamn it.

36:40.489 --> 36:42.408
- We've been compromised.
- Shit.

38:11.747 --> 38:12.915
Hey!

38:14.375 --> 38:15.584
You ready?

38:16.544 --> 38:19.547
I've been waiting for this for five years,
what do you think?

38:50.870 --> 38:55.124
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE

39:34.205 --> 39:36.374
Get out of the way! Watch out!

39:46.842 --> 39:48.636
This place hasn't changed at all.

39:50.888 --> 39:52.515
Mr. Jung!

39:53.557 --> 39:54.642
I'm home!

39:56.685 --> 39:57.770
Kill them all.

40:05.820 --> 40:07.822
You son of a bitch!

40:11.409 --> 40:13.077
You killing bastard!

40:25.965 --> 40:27.299
Shit!

41:08.007 --> 41:10.176
Stop!

41:10.259 --> 41:12.678
Stop! Stop!

41:17.183 --> 41:20.186
It's been so long, Taeju.

41:20.269 --> 41:22.396
I thought I should say hi.

41:23.898 --> 41:25.816
You asshole.

41:25.900 --> 41:26.942
Do you really think--

41:27.026 --> 41:28.944
Hey! Don't be mean.

41:31.280 --> 41:32.948
Now, come on.

41:35.034 --> 41:36.535
Aren't you glad I'm home?

41:41.123 --> 41:42.833
Stop it!

41:44.376 --> 41:47.379
You motherfucker! Goddamn it!

41:53.219 --> 41:55.054
"Kill me if you want."

41:56.805 --> 41:58.349
That's how you look.

42:00.476 --> 42:02.353
I won't do it.

42:02.937 --> 42:04.063
So calm down.

42:10.611 --> 42:11.695
Your face.

42:13.030 --> 42:13.948
Leg.

42:15.533 --> 42:16.492
Arm.

42:17.910 --> 42:20.079
Choose which one, I'll hit.

42:22.498 --> 42:24.124
It's typical.

42:27.962 --> 42:29.547
I couldn't choose.

42:42.101 --> 42:44.562
THE POWER OF SCIENCE
REVEALS THE TRUTH

42:44.645 --> 42:45.563
Thank you.

42:48.566 --> 42:49.567
Hi.

42:50.484 --> 42:51.860
Really? Okay.

42:52.444 --> 42:54.113
Hey. Will you tell him I'll call him?

42:54.196 --> 42:55.197
Thanks.

43:14.633 --> 43:15.676
Where are you?

43:16.427 --> 43:17.386
At home.

43:17.469 --> 43:18.804
Come to Dongcheon's gym.

44:10.689 --> 44:12.232
You need to get to a hospital.

44:16.695 --> 44:17.821
Stand up straight.

44:17.905 --> 44:21.158
How could you not see who attacked?
Are you kidding me?

44:21.241 --> 44:22.117
Go in.

44:24.036 --> 44:25.120
Jung Taeju.

44:26.163 --> 44:27.456
You really won't talk?

44:28.165 --> 44:29.083
Hmm?

44:45.599 --> 44:47.393
I'M BACK

44:47.476 --> 44:49.144
I don't know who it was,

44:49.728 --> 44:51.647
but someone wrecked Dongcheon's muscle.

44:53.023 --> 44:55.109
Three died
and one is in critical condition.

44:57.528 --> 44:58.654
Do they kill Choi Mujin?
